      "domain": "chunks",
      "subject": "TickingAreaManager",
      "statement": "TickingAreaManager manages temporary pack-specific ticking areas with a chunk-capacity limit independent of command ticking-area limits, and it cannot query or modify ticking areas created by other packs or commands.",
